---
title: "Coach Chat — Complete Data Flow (POST /api/coach/chat)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Browser/Mobile)
    participant R as coach.py Router
    participant SG as SafetyGate
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RQ as RetrievalQuery
    participant RAG as RAG Pipeline
    participant CP as CrossPatient
    participant DOS as Dossier Service
    participant IR as IncidentRetriever
    participant PR as Prompt Renderer
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant RG as ResponseGuard
    participant TG as TagGenerator
    participant INS as Insights Service
    participant IE as IncidentExtractor

    C->>R: POST /api/coach/chat<br/>{access_code|profile_id, patient_name,<br/>message, session_id?}

    Note over R: Resolve profile
    alt B2C Mode
        R->>DB: SELECT profile WHERE<br/>access_code_hash = SHA256(code)
    else B2B Mode
        R->>DB: SELECT profile WHERE id = profile_id
    end
    DB-->>R: Profile (stage, patterns,<br/>strategies, concerns — all encrypted)

    Note over R: Resolve locale
    R->>R: resolve_locale_code(X-App-Locale header)<br/>→ locale_code, language, constraint, model_override

    Note over R,RQ: RAG query preparation
    R->>RQ: build_english_rag_query(locale, message)
    alt Non-English locale
        RQ->>LLM: "Rewrite to English retrieval query"
        LLM-->>RQ: English query
    end
    RQ-->>R: English RAG query

    Note over R,RAG: RAG context retrieval
    R->>RAG: get_rag_context(query, k=3, min_score=0.20)
    RAG->>RAG: Embed query → 3072-dim vector
    RAG->>DB: Hybrid search:<br/>cosine_similarity + tsvector keyword(+0.15)
    DB-->>RAG: Top 9 candidates
    RAG->>RAG: Rerank by title overlap (+0.05/word)
    RAG-->>R: Top 3 chunks (formatted text)

    Note over R,CP: Cross-patient strategies
    R->>DB: SELECT profile_insights<br/>WHERE profile_id = ?
    DB-->>R: insights_json (encrypted)
    R->>R: Decrypt → extract peak_time
    R->>CP: get_cohort_strategies(stage:peak_time)
    CP->>DB: SELECT cross_patient_strategies<br/>WHERE cohort_key = ? AND total_profiles >= 5
    DB-->>CP: Strategy entries
    CP-->>R: Top 3 strategies (randomized order)

    Note over R,DOS: Behavioral dossier
    R->>DOS: get_dossier_if_fresh(profile_id)
    DOS->>DB: SELECT behavioral_dossier<br/>WHERE profile_id = ? AND is_stale = false
    alt Fresh dossier exists
        DB-->>DOS: Dossier row
    else No fresh dossier
        DOS->>DOS: compute_dossier()<br/>(weighted incidents, trends, flags)
    end
    DOS-->>R: dossier_text, contraindicated,<br/>effective, delirium_flags, pain_flags,<br/>frequency_trends (all decrypted)

    Note over R,IR: Relevant past incidents
    R->>IR: get_relevant_incidents(profile_id, message)
    IR->>IR: detect_behavior_categories(message)<br/>(keyword matching across 7 categories)
    IR->>DB: SELECT incidents WHERE<br/>profile_id = ? AND category IN (detected)<br/>ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 3
    DB-->>IR: Matching incidents
    IR-->>R: Formatted incident dicts (decrypted)

    Note over R,PR: Prompt assembly
    R->>PR: render_coach_prompt(all context)
    PR->>PR: coach_system.jinja2<br/>+ domain_knowledge.jinja2<br/>Inject: patient context, contraindicated,<br/>effective interventions, frequency trends,<br/>delirium/pain flags, dossier narrative,<br/>past incidents, RAG chunks, cross-patient,<br/>language constraints, few-shot examples
    PR-->>R: System prompt (variable length)

    Note over R: Safety gate check (pre-LLM)
    R->>SG: check_safety_gate(message, locale)
    SG->>SG: Regex match against<br/>16 EN life-threat + 10 multilingual<br/>7 EN self-harm + 10 multilingual

    alt Safety gate triggered
        SG-->>R: SafetyGateResult(triggered=true,<br/>gate_type, response_text)
        R->>C: SSE: {session_id} → {text: emergency response} → [DONE]
        R->>DB: Save user + assistant messages<br/>(is_safety_gate=true)
    else No safety trigger
        Note over R: Save user message
        R->>DB: INSERT conversation<br/>(encrypted content, locale, staff_id, facility_id)

        Note over R,C: SSE Streaming
        R->>C: SSE: data: {session_id}
        R->>LLM: stream_completion(system_prompt, messages, model_override)
        loop Each chunk
            LLM-->>R: text chunk
            R->>C: SSE: data: {text: chunk}
        end

        Note over R,RG: Post-stream validation
        R->>RG: validate_response_quality(full_text, locale)
        RG->>RG: Script ratio check (non-Latin)<br/>Romanization detection<br/>Known bad phrase check<br/>Disrespectful phrase check (EN + localized)
        alt Validation fails
            R->>RG: guard_response_text()
            RG->>LLM: Repair prompt (rewrite in correct language)
            LLM-->>RG: Repaired text
            RG->>RG: Re-validate repaired text
            alt Repair valid
                RG-->>R: Repaired text
                R->>C: SSE: data: {replace: repaired_text}
            else Repair also fails
                RG-->>R: Locale-specific fallback message
                R->>C: SSE: data: {replace: fallback}
            end
        end
        R->>C: SSE: data: [DONE]

        Note over R: Post-DONE async operations
        R->>DB: INSERT conversation (assistant, encrypted)

        par Tag generation
            R->>TG: generate_suggested_tags(response, llm)
            TG->>LLM: Extract strategy keywords from RIGHT NOW
            LLM-->>TG: JSON array of tags
            TG-->>R: predefined_tags + custom_tags
            R->>DB: UPDATE conversation SET suggested_tags = encrypt(tags)
        and Insights recomputation
            R->>INS: compute_profile_insights(profile_id)
            INS->>DB: Load all conversations, sessions, feedback, check-ins
            INS->>INS: Session frequency, trends, triggers,<br/>episode cycle detection, risk scoring
            INS->>DB: UPSERT profile_insights (if >= 3 sessions)
        and Incident extraction
            R->>IE: extract_incident_from_conversation(messages, profile)
            IE->>LLM: extraction_system.jinja2 prompt
            LLM-->>IE: JSON: {behavior_category, severity, ...}
            IE->>IE: Confidence filter (< 0.60 → null)<br/>PII scrub (names, locations, doctors)<br/>Abuse indicator check
            IE-->>R: Extraction result
            alt Valid extraction
                R->>DB: INSERT incident (auto_extracted, encrypted fields)
                R->>DB: SET behavioral_dossier.is_stale = true
            end
        end
    end
